WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.032 --> 00:00:12.072
In a summer wedding or when nerves bring on heavy sweating, humidity can quickly flatten your hair volume.

2
00:00:12.408 --> 00:00:21.216
To prevent this, we layer on an extra-strong, waterproof setting spray in stages.

3
00:00:21.552 --> 00:00:33.960
We also share a great tip: placing cooling patches on temperature-sensitive spots like the back of the neck or ankles before the ceremony to lower body temperature and curb sweating itself.

4
00:00:34.296 --> 00:00:47.136
A handheld fan is fine while getting around, but keep it at a moderate distance — holding it too close can dry out your skin and mess up loose strands.

5
00:00:47.472 --> 00:00:56.352
This method has been proven with wedding parents who struggled with sweat pouring from the scalp itself, so you can trust it.
